y\"><span class=\"fa fa-rss fa-fw\"></span> Planet</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"https://archives.gentoo.org/\" title=\"Read up on past discussions\"><span class=\"fa fa-archive fa-fw\"></span> Archives</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"https://devmanual.gentoo.org/\" title=\"Read the development guide\"><span class=\"fa fa-book fa-fw\"></span> Devmanual</a></li>\n                <li><a href=\"https://gitweb.gentoo.org/\" title=\"Browse our source code in Gitweb\"><span class=\"fa fa-code fa-fw\"></span> Gitweb</a></li>\n                <li class=\"divider\"></li>\n                <li><a href=\"https://infra-status.gentoo.org/\" title=\"Get updates on the services provided by the Gentoo infra team\"><span class=\"fa fa-server fa-fw\"></span> Infra status</a></li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"logo\">\n          <a href=\"/\" title=\"Back to the homepage\" class=\"site-logo\">\n            <img src=\"https://assets.gentoo.org/tyrian/v1/site-logo.png\" alt=\"Gentoo Linux logo\" srcset=\"https://assets.gentoo.org/tyrian/v1/site-logo.svg\">\n          </a>\n          \n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <nav class=\"tyrian-navbar\" role=\"navigation\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"navbar-header\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"navbar-toggle\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\".navbar-main-collapse\">\n            <span class=\"sr-only\">Toggle navigation</span>\n            <span class=\"icon-bar\"></span>\n            <span class=\"icon-bar\"></span>\n            <span class=\"icon-bar\"></span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse navbar-main-collapse\">\n          <ul class=\"nav navbar-nav\">\n            <li class=\"active\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a></li>\n<li class=\"\"><a href=\"/get-started/\">Get started</a></li>\n<li class=\"\"><a href=\"/downloads/\">Downloads</a></li>\n<li class=\"\"><a href=\"/inside-gentoo/\">Inside Gentoo</a></li>\n<li class=\"\"><a href=\"/support/\">Support</a></li>\n<li class=\"\"><a href=\"/get-involved/\">Get involved</a></li>\n\n          </ul>\n          <ul class=\"nav navbar-nav navbar-right\">\n            <li class=\"\"><a href=\"/donate/\"><span class=\"fa fa-heart\" style=\"color:#d9534f;\"></span> Donate</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n  \n</header>\n\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div id=\"content\" class=\"col-md-12\">\n          </div></div></div>\n<div class=\"hero-section emergehdr\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-8 col-md-9\">\n    <p>\n      Welcome to Gentoo, a highly flexible, source-based Linux distribution.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-4 col-md-3 buttons\">\n    <a href=\"get-started/about/\" class=\"btn btn-default btn-block\">Learn more</a>\n    <a href=\"get-started/\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\"><i class=\"fa fa-fw fa-rocket\"></i> Get started now</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-md-12\">\n\n<section id=\"news\">\n  \n  <article class=\"newsitem\">\n    <h2 class=\"stick-top newsitem-bullet\">\n      <span class=\"fa fa-fw fa-chevron-circle-right\" title=\"News item\"> </span>\n    </h2>\n    <h2 class=\"stick-top newsitem-headline\">\n      <a href=\"/news/2026/10/24/emudhra-intermediate-ca-compromise.html\">eMudhra Intermediate CA Compromise</a> <small>(Oct 24, 2026)</small>\n    </h2>\n    <div class=\"newsitem-content\">\n      <p>On 2026-10-20, it has been disclosed that <a href=\"https://emudhra.we-have-a-problem.com/\">the private keys of eight\neMudhra intermediate CA certificates have been\ncompromised</a>.  These keys can be\nused to issue forged CA certificates that would be considered fully\ntrusted by the affected software, and therefore could be used to perform\nman-in-the-middle attacks.</p>\n\n<p>Importantly, the vulnerability can also affect software self-update\nprocesses that use TLS verification as the only security measure, with\nan attempt to upgrade the system leading to it being compromised.\nThe standard Gentoo configuration mitigates this risk, as both\nthe ebuild repository updates and binary package downloads are secured\nusing OpenPGP keys.  A malicious third party may be able to intercept\nupdate requests, but Portage will reject any tampered packages or\nmetadata.</p>\n\n<p>The baseline remediation is to upgrade to\n<code class=\"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge\">&gt;=app-misc/ca-certificates-20260816.3.125</code>.  However, some packages are\nusing bundled certificate stores and require separate remediation.  In\nsome cases the bundled certificates are updated automatically, in others,\nthe relevant packages will need to be upgraded.  We are actively\ntracking the affected packages in <a href=\"https://bugs.gentoo.org/984601\">bug\n984601</a>, and releasing fixed versions to\nGentoo stable ASAP.  We are also looking into forcing the use of\nthe system certificate store in more packages, per our <a href=\"https://devmanual.gentoo.org/general-concepts/bundled-deps/index.html\">unbundling\npolicy</a>.</p>\n\n<p>Please note that packages installed outside Gentoo package manager are\nalso affected.  For example, Python virtual environments featuring\nthe prior versions of <code class=\"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge\">certifi</code>, <code class=\"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge\">pip</code> or <code class=\"language-plaintext highlighter-rouge\">uv</code> packages are vulnerable.\nPlease refer to the <a href=\"https://discuss.python.org/t/information-for-python-users-regarding-emudhra-emsign-ca-certificate-security-incident/109576\">Python upstream\nannouncement</a>\nfor more details and the recommended remediation.</p>\n\n      \n    </div>\n  </article>\n  \n  <article class=\"newsitem\">\n    <h2 class=\"stick-top newsitem-bullet\">\n      <span class=\"fa fa-fw fa-chevron-circle-right\" title=\"News item\"> </span>\n    </h2>\n    <h2 class=\"stick-top newsitem-headline\">\n      <a href=\"/news/2026/10/07/infrastructure-sponsors-wanted.html\">Gentoo infrastructure sponsors wanted!</a> <small>(Oct 7, 2026)</small>\n    </h2>\n    <div class=\"newsitem-content\">\n      <p><a href=\"https://wiki.gentoo.org/wiki/Project:Infrastructure/Sponsorship\" class=\"news-img-right\">\n  <img src=\"https://www.gentoo.org/assets/img/news/2026/larry-server.png\" alt=\"Larry behind a server rack\" />\n</a></p>\n\n<p>EDIT 2026/10/18: To speed up the process, please include <a href=\"https://wiki.gentoo.org/wiki/Project:Infrastructure/Sponsorship#Initial_Arrangements\">critical\ndetails</a>\nin your initial email to <a href=\"mailto:infra@gentoo.org\">infra@gentoo.org</a>.\nThe Gentoo Infra team have received offers with poor connectivity or lacking\npublic IPs, and we strive to be good neighbor in any sponsored environment.</p>\n\n<p>Gentoo Linux is made possible by many community donations and sponsors, together with the\nenthusiastic work of our developers. Unfortunately, this year several long-running sponsors were unable\nto continue their prior support, and at the moment we are looking for replacements.</p>\n\n<p><b>Are you or your organization interested in supporting Gentoo via an infrastructure\nsponsorship?</b> There are <a href=\"https://wiki.gentoo.org/wiki/Project:Infrastructure/Sponsorship\">many ways to do that</a>,\nranging from providing rack space or servers in a data center to donating server hardware;\ndetails and typical arrangements are described on a <a href=\"https://wiki.gentoo.org/wiki/Project:Infrastructure/Sponsorship\">wiki page of the Infrastructure\nproject</a>. Partnerships with\norganizations aligning with Gentoo’s goals are strongly preferred. We can be reached at\n<a href=\"mailto:infra@gentoo.org\">infra@gentoo.org</a>. Please help us continue to provide the\nbest source-based Linux distribution ever!</p>\n\n      \n    </div>\n  </article>\n  \n</section>\n\n\n<div class=\"news-more\">\n  <a href=\"/news\" class=\"btn btn-xs\">All news items <span class=\"fa fa-fw fa-chevron-right\"></span></a>\n  <hr>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6\">\n    <h2>Developer blogs <small>live from <a href=\"https://planet.gentoo.org\">Planet Gentoo</a></small></h2>\n    <table class=\"table table-striped frontpage-table\">\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"frontpage-table-planet-author\">mgorny</td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://blogs.gentoo.org/mgorny/2026/10/27/the-next-circle-of-security-hell/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"The next circle of security hell\">The next circle of security hell</a></td>\n    </tr>\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"frontpage-table-planet-author\">ago</td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://blogs.gentoo.org/ago/2026/10/26/php-8-1-on-gentoo-after-cve-2026-109618-and-cve-2026-109619/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"php-8.1 on gentoo after CVE-2026-109618 and CVE-2026-109619\">php-8.1 on gentoo after CVE-2026-109618 and CVE-2026-109619</a></td>\n    </tr>\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"frontpage-table-planet-author\">GentooNews</td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://www.gentoo.org/news/2026/10/24/emudhra-intermediate-ca-compromise.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"eMudhra Intermediate CA Compromise\">eMudhra Intermediate CA Compromise</a></td>\n    </tr>\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"frontpage-table-planet-author\">mgorny</td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://blogs.gentoo.org/mgorny/2026/10/12/a-plea-not-to-use-uv-build/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"A plea not to use uv-build\">A plea not to use uv-build</a></td>\n    </tr>\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"frontpage-table-planet-author\">GentooNews</td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://www.gentoo.org/news/2026/10/07/infrastructure-sponsors-wanted.html\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Gentoo infrastructure sponsors wanted!\">Gentoo infrastructure sponsors wanted!</a></td>\n    </tr>\n  \n</table>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6\">\n    <h2>Security advisories <small>from our <a href=\"https://security.gentoo.org/\">Security database</a></small></h2>\n    <table class=\"table table-striped\">\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td>GLSA 202610-02</td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202610-02\">PHP: Multiple Vulnerabilities</a></td>\n      <td class=\"text-right\">\n        \n          <span class=\"label label-danger\">high</span>\n        \n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td>GLSA 202610-01</td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202610-01\">ca-certificates: Compromised Intermediate Certificate Authority</a></td>\n      <td class=\"text-right\">\n        \n          <span class=\"label label-danger\">high</span>\n        \n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td>GLSA 202609-03</td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202609-03\">Ruby: Remote code execution</a></td>\n      <td class=\"text-right\">\n        \n          <span class=\"label label-danger\">high</span>\n        \n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td>GLSA 202609-02</td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202609-02\">Chromium, Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, Opera, Vivaldi: Multiple Vulnerabilities</a></td>\n      <td class=\"text-right\">\n        \n          <span class=\"label label-danger\">high</span>\n        \n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td>GLSA 202609-01</td>\n      <td><a href=\"https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202609-01\">Chromium, Google Chrome, Microsoft Edge, Opera, Vivaldi: Multiple Vulnerabilities</a></td>\n      <td class=\"text-right\">\n        \n          <span class=\"label label-danger\">high</span>\n        \n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  \n</table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6\">\n    <h2>New packages <small>at the <a href=\"https://packages.gentoo.org\">Gentoo packages database</a></small></h2>\n    <table class=\"table table-striped frontpage-table\">\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"frontpage-table-package-atom\"><a href=\"https://packages.gentoo.org/package/dev-build/cython-cmake\">dev-build/cython-cmake</a></td>\n      <td>CMake helpers for building Cython modules</td>\n    </tr>\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"frontpage-table-package-atom\"><a href=\"https://packages.gentoo.org/package/sec-keys/openpgp-keys-zendodd\">sec-keys/openpgp-keys-zendodd</a></td>\n      <td>OpenPGP keys used by Zen Dodd</td>\n    </tr>\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"frontpage-table-package-atom\"><a href=\"https://packages.gentoo.org/package/gui-apps/lxqt-clip\">gui-apps/lxqt-clip</a></td>\n      <td>Clipboard History Applet for X11 and Wayland</td>\n    </tr>\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"frontpage-table-package-atom\"><a href=\"https://packages.gentoo.org/package/dev-cpp/parallel-hashmap\">dev-cpp/parallel-hashmap</a></td>\n      <td>Family of header-only, fast and memory-friendly hashmap and btree containers</td>\n    </tr>\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"frontpage-table-package-atom\"><a href=\"https://packages.gentoo.org/package/app-emacs/fj\">app-emacs/fj</a></td>\n      <td>GNU Emacs client for interacting with remote Forgejo instances</td>\n    </tr>\n  \n</table>\n\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-6\">\n    <h2>Fresh documentation <small>on the <a href=\"https://wiki.gentoo.org/\">Gentoo wiki</a></small></h2>\n    <table class=\"table table-striped frontpage-table\">\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"frontpage-table-wiki-title\"><a href=\"https://wiki.gentoo.org/wiki/Nftables/Rules/Return\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nftables/Rules/Return</a></td>\n      <td>started by Egberts</td>\n    </tr>\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"frontpage-table-wiki-title\"><a href=\"https://wiki.gentoo.org/wiki/Gentoo_installation_tips_and_tricks/fr\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gentoo installation tips and tricks/fr</a></td>\n      <td>started by Resowifix</td>\n    </tr>\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"frontpage-table-wiki-title\"><a href=\"https://wiki.gentoo.org/wiki/Nftables/Rules/Jump\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nftables/Rules/Jump</a></td>\n      <td>started by Egberts</td>\n    </tr>\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"frontpage-table-wiki-title\"><a href=\"https://wiki.gentoo.org/wiki/Nftables/Rules/Goto\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nftables/Rules/Goto</a></td>\n      <td>started by Egberts</td>\n    </tr>\n  \n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"frontpage-table-wiki-title\"><a href=\"https://wiki.gentoo.org/wiki/Windowmaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">Windowmaker</a></td>\n      <td>started by Riaapup</td>\n    </tr>\n  \n</table>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<hr>\n\n<div class=\"row sponsor\">\n  <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-2 col-md-offset-2 sponsorlogo\"><!-- sponsor{name:OSL,weight:110} --><a href=\"https://osuosl.org/contribute\" title=\"OSL\"><img src=\"/assets/img/sponsors/ads/osuosl.png\" alt=\"OSL\"></a></div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-2 sponsorlogo\"><!-- sponsor{name:LeaseWeb,weight:8} --><a href=\"https://www.leaseweb.com/\" title=\"LeaseWeb\"><img src=\"/assets/img/sponsors/ads/leaseweb.png\" alt=\"LeaseWeb\"></a></div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-2 sponsorlogo\"><!-- sponsor{name:SevenL,weight:2} --><a href=\"https://www.sevenl.net/?utm_source=gentoo-org&utm_medium=sponsored-banner&utm_campaign=gentoo-dedicated-servers\" title=\"SevenL\"><img src=\"/assets/img/sponsors/ads/sevenl.png\" alt=\"SevenL\"></a></div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-2 sponsorlogo\"><!-- sponsor{name:Numberly,weight:64} --><a href=\"https://www.numberly.com/\" title=\"Numberly\"><img src=\"/assets/img/sponsors/ads/numberly.png\" alt=\"Numberly\"></a></div>\n\n</div>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-offset-2 col-md-7\">\n        \n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-m